Hello, I'm trying to run a Tukey Kramer test in conjunction with an ANOVA test using r and JGR. I can't figure out how to access and run the tests from the drop down menus in JGR. Any help finding the tests in the drop down menus and/or writing the code for the Tukey Kramer test would be greatly appreciated! Thanks.

